# =====================================================================
#  AISEHack 2.0 Round 3 - Team 8bit
#  Repo policy: ship the submission, the pipeline source, and the small
#  tables needed to audit it. Keep out competition data, derived rasters,
#  and anything the pipeline regenerates.
#
#  Layout mirrors the Round 2 repo:
#     SUBMISSION/  final submission artifacts
#     output/      generated report sources (midnight check-in)
#     pipeline/    processing scripts  (its runtime subfolders are ignored)
# =====================================================================

# ---- competition data (1.7 GB; not ours to redistribute) --------------
DATA/

# ---- organisers' blank template (their document, not our submission) --
Midnight_Checkin_AISEHack_RemoteSensing_Track.docx

# ---- pipeline runtime outputs: all regenerated by running the code ----
pipeline/geo/*.tif
pipeline/geo/*.tiff
pipeline/s2/*.npy
pipeline/*.tif
pipeline/copdem_*.tif
pipeline/nbtest/
pipeline/fig/
pipeline/*.png
pipeline/*.jpg
pipeline/*.jpeg
pipeline/*.b64
pipeline/round3_review.html
pipeline/artifact_src.html

# ---- regenerable intermediate tables ---------------------------------
#      The JSON parameter records in pipeline/out and pipeline/geo ARE kept:
#      they document calibration, co-registration and model settings, which
#      is evidence. The bulk CSVs are pure by-products and the meaningful
#      ones already ship in SUBMISSION/.
pipeline/out/*.csv

# ---- Goa finals deck: held back until the final submission -----------
#      Still generated by tools/90_make_ppt.py and still required as
#      attachment (d) of the Kaggle Writeup. Delete this line to publish it.
SUBMISSION/*.pptx

# ---- Round 2 archive: keep only the carry-forward labels the ----------
#      Round 3 pipeline actually reads
round_2_submmision_files/*
!round_2_submmision_files/farm_level_results.csv

# ---- LaTeX build artefacts (the compiled PDF itself IS committed) -----
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.synctex.gz
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk

# ---- Python ----------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ---- OS / editor -----------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
